RetroVega
Copyright (c) 2026 Daniel Reiter Horn
All rights reserved.

Everything in this directory (retrovega/) is under the BSD 2-Clause License
below: the game's code (src/, abi/, host/, desktop/), its tools (tools/), its
tests and documents, its data (data/), and its artwork -- the characters and
their faces, the rooms of the carrier, the cockpits, the armour plate, the
music, the sounds and the voices -- EXCEPT the files named under
"Exceptions" further down.

The only part of RetroVega derived from someone else's GPL work is the
pictures of the spaceships, rendered from the Vega Strike project's ship
models (Vega Strike Assets-Production, GPL-2.0, (c) the Vega Strike
contributors).  Those files are named one by one below and stay under the
GNU General Public License, version 2 (the text is in COPYING.GPL-2.0).  Someone
who models their own craft and renders them in place of these files has a
game that is BSD-licensed throughout.

RetroVega is a DOS program.  It runs in any DOS or DOS emulator; it does not
contain or link DOSBox, and DOSBox's GPL does not reach it.


